---
import AdminLayout from '../../layouts/AdminLayout.astro';
---
<AdminLayout title="Dashboard">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
    <h1 style="margin: 0;">Dashboard</h1>
    <a href="/admin/escribir" style="background: #0070f3; color: white; padding: 0.5rem 1rem; border-radius: 4px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500;">+ New Post</a>
  </div>
  
  <p>Welcome to the admin panel. Here you can manage your posts.</p>
  
  <div style="margin-top: 2rem;">
    <h2>Your Posts</h2>
    <div style="background: white; padding: 2rem; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd; text-align: center; color: #666;">
      <p>No posts yet. <a href="/admin/escribir" style="color: #0070f3;">Write one now!</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</AdminLayout>
